<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Cullinan issues further cautionary.</title>
<headline>Cullinan issues further cautionary.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-05-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>South African industrial holdings firm Cullinan Holdings Ltd said on Monday that due diligence exercises related to its planned purchase of unlisted Midmacor Industries Ltd, were continuing.</p>
<p>The company said in cautionary announcement that shareholders should exercise caution in their share dealings until further notice.</p>
<p>Cullinan said on April 21 it planned a share issue to fund the acquisition of Midmacor, the business of which comprises principally the Cadac outdoor products and the national Honda motorcycle and power products distrubutorship.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
